@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Local player search (no credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/playerSearch
Content-Type: application/json

{"playerToSearch":"Stephen Curry"}

### Local comparison (no credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{"player1Id":115,"player2Id":237}

### DEPRECATED Optional export reference only
GET https://api.balldontlie.io/v1/players?search=curry
Authorization: {{$dotenv API_KEY}}

### DEPRECATED Optional season averages export reference only
GET https://api.balldontlie.io/v1/season_averages?season=2025&player_id=115
Authorization: {{$dotenv API_KEY}}
